      "evidence_id": "S002"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-1508",
      "en": "My doctor mentioned gestational hypertension. When during pregnancy does this type of high blood pressure usually start?",
      "zh": "我的医生提到了妊娠期高血压。这种类型的高血压通常在怀孕期间的什么时候开始？",
      "evidence_id": "S009"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-204",
      "en": "I'm having trouble hearing and wondering if it's because sound waves can't reach my inner ear. What are some common physical causes for this blockage?",
      "zh": "我听力有些困难，想知道是不是因为声波无法到达内耳。造成这种阻塞的常见身体原因有哪些？",
      "evidence_id": "S006"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-1255",
      "en": "I've heard that taking certain medicines can lead to a yeast infection. Which specific type of medicine is known to allow yeast to multiply and cause an infection?",
      "zh": "我听说服用某些药物会导致酵母菌感染。哪种特定类型的药物已知会让酵母菌繁殖并引发感染？",
      "evidence_id": "S003"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-6236",
      "en": "I plan to get my flu shot soon. How long after getting the injection does it take for my body to start making antibodies for protection?",
      "zh": "我打算很快去打流感疫苗。注射后需要多长时间我的身体才会开始产生抗体来提供保护？",
      "evidence_id": "S018"
    }
  ]
}
